WEBVTT

00:17:58.125 --> 00:18:02.059
EP: It is the universal game
that every kid plays, actually,

00:18:02.083 --> 00:18:05.893
and still, it's really
across the globe, that notion,

00:18:05.917 --> 00:18:07.976
but it really anchors you.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:10.976
I mean, that to me
is the beginning of trust.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.684
AG: So when I think about taking this
into the workplace,

00:18:13.708 --> 00:18:15.851
then one of the things
that jumps to mind is,

00:18:15.875 --> 00:18:19.226
I got a really interesting query
from a reporter a couple of weeks ago,

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:21.518
who said, "What do you
think about organizations

00:18:21.542 --> 00:18:23.893
that have practices
of requiring open calendars?"

00:18:23.917 --> 00:18:27.226
And I immediately thought
of this particular,

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.268
I guess, revelation for me,
where I would have said in the past,